# Never send local credentials to a Docker builder, including a remote builder.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Host dependency/build state must not influence a clean image build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.pnpm-store
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/coverage
**/test-results

# Runtime data and local tooling state are not image inputs.
project-data
**/data
**/logs
**/backups
.git
.github
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.log
